  ring 932.1 mm round, radius 148.4 mm; the h = 4 ramp drawn at lap 67, 117.0 eV synchronous: four bunches a quarter lap apart; the image of a centred line charge on the four quarters: 0.2500, 0.2500, 0.2500, 0.2500
